# Root .env.local is written by `pnpm dev:convex` (CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT, CONVEX_URL, CONVEX_SITE_URL).
# Vite exposes CONVEX_URL to the web app via envPrefix; nothing to copy by hand.

# Convex deployment env (set with `npx convex env set NAME value`, not read from this file)
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=      Claude for both agents
# RETRIEVAL_URL=          FastAPI service (Railway/Fly), e.g. https://auditor-retrieval.up.railway.app

# CRS and Moss credentials live in retrieval/.env (see retrieval/.env.example), never in Convex or the browser.
